# Uses of GitHub Actions artifact/cache storage that remain, one per line:
#   <file> <pattern>
# See scripts/ci/check-actions-storage.py. This list only shrinks.

# `make test-ios`, `make ios-previews`, `make ios-ui-shot` and `make simlab-run` dispatch to
# a hosted macOS VM, which cannot reach the receipt store, and hand the dispatcher its
# screenshots and verdicts. A one-day result for a person at a workstation, not a record:
# scripts/qa/native-test-isolation.py downloads it by request id.
.github/workflows/native-test-isolation.yml upload-artifact
scripts/qa/native-test-isolation.py gh-run-download
